* Extensions/corecrypto (checked file by file on 2026-11-21):
- From PureDarwin's corecrypto (github.com/PureDarwin/corecrypto,
  commit 4a020c8, whose LICENSE.md licenses its original code under the
  Apache License 2.0): cc_clear.c, cc_cmp_safe.c, cc_debug.c, cc_digest.c,
  kext/cc_functions.c, kext/cc_kext_main.c, kext/Info.plist, makefile,
  user/dummy.c (SPDX:Apache-2.0)
- From the published xnu: the Yarrow generator (algorithms/yarrow),
  kext/register_crypto.h and kext/prng_random.h (SPDX:APSL-2.0); the
  headers in include/corecrypto, identical to xnu-6153.141.1's
  EXTERNAL_HEADERS/corecrypto (part of that APSL-2.0 release)
- Minkar's own: the digests and AES (algorithms/digest.c, md5.c, sha1.c,
  sha2.c, aes.c), the unsupported entries (algorithms/unsupported.c),
  include/corecrypto/ccrsa.h, cc_abort.h, and the changes to cckprng.c
  (SPDX:BSD-2-Clause)
